                        "com.vivo.permissionmanager.activity.BgStartUpManagerActivity",
                    ),
                ).apply { flags = Intent.FLAG_ACTIVITY_NEW_TASK },
            )
            else -> emptyList()
        }
    }

    private val AGGRESSIVE_OEMS = setOf(
        "xiaomi", "redmi", "poco",
        "huawei", "honor",
        "oppo", "realme",
        "vivo",
        "samsung",
    )
}

